│  - **10:00 AM:** Check-in at **Hotel Ritz Madrid** (€150/night) or **Hotel Arts Madrid** (€120/night)         │
│  - **11:00 AM:** Explore **Palacio Real** (€15 entry) – Royal Palace with opulent halls.                      │
│  - **1:00 PM:** Lunch at **Casa Miguel** (€15) – Traditional Spanish tapas.                                   │
│                                                                                                               │
│  ### 📚 Afternoon                                                                                             │
│  - **2:30 PM:** Stroll through **Barrio de las Letras** (literary quarter) – Home to Madrid’s literary        │
│  history.                                                                                                     │
│  - **4:00 PM:** Visit **Museo Sorolla** (€12) – Impressionist art by Joaquín Sorolla.                         │
│  - **6:00 PM:** Dinner at **Casa de Velázquez** (€20) – Michelin-starred Spanish cuisine.                     │
│                                                                                                               │
│  ### 🌙 Evening                                                                                               │
│  - **8:00 PM:** Flamenco show at **Teatro Lírico** (€30) – Experience authentic Spanish culture.              │
│                                                                                                               │
│  ---                                                                                                          │
│                                                                                                               │
│  ## 🗓️ Day 2: Art & History                                                                                    │
│  **Theme:** Museums & Monuments                                                                               │
│  **Weather:** 11°C / 3°C                                                                                      │
│                                                                                                               │
