│  - **4:30 PM:** **Museo Nacional de Escultura** (€12) – Sculpture masterpieces.                               │
│  - **6:30 PM:** Dinner at **Casa Botines** (€25) – Elegant dining with views.                                 │
│                                                                                                               │
│  ### 🌙 Evening                                                                                               │
│  - **8:30 PM:** **Catedral de la Almudena** – Gothic cathedral with stunning views.                           │
│                                                                                                               │
│  ---                                                                                                          │
│                                                                                                               │
